cently check you know if i had to  engage a teacher and go there once or  twice a week and then they decide okay  here's what we're going to study today  and i wouldn't get anywhere whereas this  way now granted you can't start from  scratch and start reading an audio book  on  on audible.com but there again as i've  mentioned before for romanian i just  wrote up sort of basic patterns of  commonly used you know concepts that we  like to express why because uh if  therefore  whatever it might be how when how many  200 phrases sentences i put it up  on on odesk uh please translate and  record back it comes okay it cost me a  bit of money but i put it up on link so  other people can enjoy it and i get  frequent comments from people thanking  me for having put those contents uh up  on a link up on link i i mean there's  more to it than that it's just there's  the italki's you can get on the internet  talk to other people if you want i don't  do a lot of that myself  um it's just just so easy i remember  some years ago i was approached by the  local community college to donate money  to their language lab and i said myself  why would you have a language lab  there's so much stuff available now  so  i'm just so much looking forward to  getting back into my swedish and  japanese and all these other languages  to prepare for my talk i don't know if  it improves the quality of my video but  it gives me motivation and remember  motivation is key it gives me a  motivation for doing it it's extremely  enjoyable  and so i really believe  that we live in the golden age of  language learning and in fact in many  ways we live in a golden age it's so  easy to get discouraged by all the bad  news that we hear but i mean when i  listened to the spanish civil war in the  second world war and went on them not  that that's a standard but  um  yeah there are issues  but i think that  we're solving them i'm quite convinced  that within 20 or 30 years the main  source of energy will be solar we'll  have massive batteries and we will have  resolved some of these issues that  surround energy and uh you know fossil  fuels and so forth and so on so i as  i've said many many times  i'm an optimist and i'm very happy to  live in the golden age of language  learning so that should encourage you to  go out there and do more language  learning bye for now
 

